filters. If they are blocked by dust, the compressor has to work twice as hard to satisfy your thermostat. \n                        </p>\n                        <p class=\"m-0\">\n                            Rinse the mesh screens under a cool tap and dry them before sliding them back. Clear airflow ensures a powerful stream of cold air right when you need it.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-bold text-[#1A202C] mb-4 flex items-center mt-0\"><i class=\"fas fa-bolt text-red-500 mr-3 m-0\"></i> 2. Defending the Electronic Brain</h3>\n                        <p class=\"mb-4 m-0\">\n                            Your National AC&#8217;s electronic logic board is sensitive to voltage spikes in Vadodara. A sudden jolt of electricity can instantly fry its circuits, leaving it completely unresponsive.\n                        </p>\n                        <p class=\"m-0\">\n                            If your unit goes numb after a storm, don&#8217;t assume it&#8217;s lost. Our specialists in <strong>National inverter AC PCB repair Vadodara</strong> can often micro-solder the damaged points, restoring the unit to full operation.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"py-16 bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-3xl my-12 shadow-2xl\">\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-6xl py-12 m-0\">\n                <div class=\"text-center mb-16 m-0\">\n                    <h2 class=\"font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-extrabold text-white relative inline-block after:content-[''] after:absolute after:-bottom-2.5 after:left-1/2 after:-translate-x-1/2 after:w-[60px] after:h-1 after:bg-[#D4AF37] after:rounded-sm text-3xl md:text-5xl mb-6 m-0 text-white\">Diagnostic Codes</h2>\n                    <p class=\"text-xl text-gray