     <td class=\"p-6 text-gray-400 m-0\">The room temperature sensor has likely failed. We can restore function with our <strong>National AC sensor repair</strong> service.</td>\n                                </tr>\n                                <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-700/50 transition-colors m-0\">\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 font-black text-[#D4AF37] text-xl m-0\">EC</td>\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 font-medium text-gray-300 m-0\">Gas Leak</td>\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 text-gray-400 m-0\">Refrigerant levels are critical. Power off the machine to protect the compressor and contact us for leak testing and recharge.</td>\n                                </tr>\n                            </tbody>\n                        </table>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section id=\"pricing\" class=\"py-16 bg-white m-0\">\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-5xl m-0 text-center\">\n                <h2 class=\"font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-extrabold text-[#1A202C] relative inline-block after:content-[''] after:absolute after:-bottom-2.5 after:left-1/2 after:-translate-x-1/2 after:w-[60px] after:h-1 after:bg-[#D4AF37] after:rounded-sm text-3xl md:text-5xl mb-6 m-0\">Transparent Pricing</h2>\n                <p class=\"text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-6 m-0\">Clear and competitive rates for <strong>National AC service in Vadodara</strong>.</p>\n                \n                <div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-1 md:p-8 rounded-3xl border border-gray-200 shadow-sm mt-8 m-0 overflow-hidden\">\n                    <table class=\"w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm m-0\">\n                        <thead>\n                            <tr class=\"bg-[#D4AF37]/10 text-[#1A202C] m-0\">\n                                <th class=\"p-5 font-bold border