               </tr>\n                            <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors m-0\">\n                                <td class=\"p-5 font-semibold m-0\">Gas Refilling</td>\n                                <td class=\"p-5 text-gray-500 hidden md:table-cell m-0 text-center text-sm\">Sealing the leak and refilling R32/R410A gas</td>\n                                <td class=\"p-5 font-bold text-[#D4AF37] text-right whitespace-nowrap m-0\">₹2500 &#8211; ₹4500</td>\n                            </tr>\n                        </tbody>\n                    </table>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs text-gray-400 mt-4 text-center m-0\">*Final <strong>National AC repair cost Vadodara</strong> quotes are provided after site inspection.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"py-16 bg-[#1A202C] text-white relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl my-12 text-center m-0 shadow-xl\">\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-10 m-0\" style=\"background-image: radial-gradient(#D4AF37 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 30px 30px;\"></div>\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10 py-12 m-0 text-center flex flex-col items-center\">\n                <h2 class=\"font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-extrabold text-white relative inline-block after:content-[''] after:absolute after:-bottom-2.5 after:left-1/2 after:-translate-x-1/2 after:w-[60px] after:h-1 after:bg-[#D4AF37] after:rounded-sm text-3xl md:text-5xl mb-6 m-0 text-white\">Serving All Vadodara Districts</h2>\n                <p class=\"text-xl text-gray-400 mt-6 leading-relaxed max-w-4xl mx-auto m-0\">\n                    If you are searching for <strong>National AC service near me</strong>, our independent technicians are roamining Alkapuri, Makarpura, Karelibaug, Nizampura, and Tandalja.\n                </p>\n                <div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 max-w-5xl mx-auto mt-12 m-0\