d by, or sponsored by the National brand. When we use the name &#8220;National&#8221; on our site, it is strictly to let you know that our technicians are trained to fix that specific brand.\n                        </p>\n                        <p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-sm mb-0 m-0\">\n                            We support your right to choose who maintains your appliances. Independent shops often provide faster response times than brand-exclusive centers. However, please know that if your AC is still under its original warranty, letting an independent company work on it might void that warranty. We provide our own independent 3 to 6-month warranty on our work.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <footer class=\"bg-[#1A202C] text-gray-400 py-12 rounded-3xl mt-12 border-t-4 border-[#D4AF37] m-0\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 text-center m-0\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-white font-black text-2xl m-0 tracking-tight mt-0\">ATLAS<span class=\"text-[#D4AF37] m-0\">AIRCON</span></h3>\n            <p class=\"text-sm mt-4 max-w-xl mx-auto m-0\">The authority in independent air conditioning repairs across Vadodara. Engineering mastery, transparent pricing, and 24/7 reliability.</p>\n            <div class=\"flex justify-center space-x-6 mt-8 m-0\">\n                <a href=\"tel:+919727257141\" class=\"text-[#D4AF37] hover:text-white transition-colors text-lg font-bold no-underline flex items-center m-0\">\n                    <i class=\"fas fa-phone-alt mr-2 m-0\"></i> +91 97272 57141\n                </a>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"text-xs mt-8 m-0\">&copy; 2026 Atlas Aircon Engineering. All Rights Reserved. Independent Service Provider.</p>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n\n    <script>\n        // Intelligent Image Error Handler\n        function handleImageError(element) {\n            element.onerror = nul